  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></math> . Consider the system of linear equations<br /><math><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></math><br />Which of the following statement(s) is (are) correct ?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "7IIp7",
      "text": "If <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the system has infinitely many solutions for all values of <math><mi>λ</mi></math> and <math><mi>μ</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7xXf0",
      "text": "If <math><mi>a</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>≠</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the system has a unique solution for all values of <math><mi>λ</mi></math> and <math><mi>μ</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NWYNC",
      "text": "If <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the system has infinitely many solutions for <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "MmVu4",
      "text": "If <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the system has no solution for <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi></math><br />If&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math> lines will be parallel or coincident, parallel for <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and coincident if <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and if <math><mi>a</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math> lines are intersecting <math><mo>⇒</mo></math> unique solution.<br />If parallel then no solution &amp; If coincident then infinite solution<p>&nbsp;</p>",
